# Token Cost Convention

## Source of truth

All token charges MUST be resolved from `public.token_cost_rules` (feature, platform, media_type, optional source_platform).

Do not hardcode token amounts in application code except as migration seed defaults.

## Lookup keys

| Feature | `feature` value | Notes |
|---------|-----------------|-------|
| Auto Download/Upload | `auto_download_upload` | Use `source_platform` (instagram, youtube, tiktok) for tiered costs |
| Direct Post | `direct_post` | `media_type`: text, image, video |
| Direct Schedule | `direct_schedule` | Same media types |
| InApp Schedule | `inapp_schedule` | Same media types |

Use `media_type = '*'` as wildcard when a single cost applies to all types.

## Timing

Deduct tokens **after** successful publish only. Record in `token_transactions` with appropriate metadata.

## Changing prices

Super-admin UI is deferred; adjust rows in `token_cost_rules` in the database until UI exists.
